00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:17.480
It was obvious that now that the Pfizer covid
vaccine is FDA approved, you were going to

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:22.260
start hearing from the right saying, I don't
know that we can trust this approval.

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:23.859
This may have been rushed.

00:00:23.859 --> 00:00:27.670
The Biden administration may have accelerated
it when it really shouldn't have been approved

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:29.519
yet or whatever the case may be.

00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:31.199
Now, why is this relevant?

00:00:31.199 --> 00:00:35.910
This is relevant again, because I only you
know, I know that the right is now just about

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:37.650
owning the Libs.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:40.000
I don't care about crap like that, OK?

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.530
What I want is let's get people vaccinated
so the excuse can start emptying out and so

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:51.730
that we have room in hospitals for people
who get into a car accident, get hurt at work,

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:54.480
whatever the case may be, that my priority
is health.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:01:02.170
OK, one third of those who were resisting
the vaccine said if and when there is a full

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:06.180
approval, then I will go and get vaccinated.

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:07.600
So that's a really important thing.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:15.080
So we care about how media and the right reacts
to news of the approval.

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:21.900
Here is a Fox News segment that opens yesterday
by saying, was it rushed or was it rushed?

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:24.060
Take a listen to
Speaker 2: a Fox News alert for you.

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:28.030
Now, the FDA just giving full approval to
Pfizer's Kobad vaccine.

00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:32.580
