00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:35.440
Was it?

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:36.950
Well, let's bring in Admiral Bradshaw now.

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:43.890
Speaker 1: OK, there are people who said it's
unfair to show only that because Dr. Brett

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:46.020
Jira comes in and says, no, it's safe.

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:49.909
