00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.030
It might have been a little faster, but it
is complicated.

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:35.349
There's a lot of material and Americans should
feel very confident in the process.

00:03:35.349 --> 00:03:39.670
Speaker 2: Some have said that they were hesitant
to get the vaccine and pointed to this lack

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:41.990
