00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:51.520
Speaker 3: Well, I think the American people
will utilize the news.

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:54.810
The polls said about 30 percent of those who
have not been vaccinated.

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:55.810
Right.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:59.630
Would become vaccinated, feel very confident
