00:04:00.879 --> 00:04:01.879
That just happened.

00:04:01.879 --> 00:04:03.230
The vaccine is fully approved.

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:08.560
And I am very hopeful that this will push
people over the edge to go get the vaccine

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:09.720
