00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.360
Speaker 1: So you guys get the point.

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:17.650
So so listen, the full video shows the guests
saying it wasn't rushed and people should

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:18.650
